# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/

# Price data are NOT committed: they belong to their providers (Yahoo Finance,
# bolsamania.com, FRED) and redistribution may be restricted.
# `python run_all.py` downloads whatever is missing.
# What IS committed:
#   manifest.json   source and download date of every file
#   membership.csv  who was in the S&P 500 and when
data/raw/*
!data/raw/manifest.json
!data/raw/membership.csv
